{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411260","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1241126001:1":{"text":"어린 시절의 나는 거지, 도둑, 소매치기였어. 빵 한 조각을 위해서 들개와 싸우기까지 했지.","source_cn":"我小时候当过乞丐、小偷、扒手。甚至为了一口面包，和野狗打架。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75C38337C8C9D1B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241126002:1":{"text":"살아남기 위해 머리를 자르고 남장도 해봤어. 남자아이는 일을 구하기도 쉽고, 표적이 되지도 않으니까.","source_cn":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BAC3E4078F8664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1241126002":{"text":"살아남기 위해 머리를 자르고 남장도 해봤어. 남자아이는 일을 구하기도 쉽고, 표적이 되지도 않으니까.","source_cn":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找工作，而且不会被盯上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BAC3E4078F8664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241126003:1":{"text":"러스트 항에는 이런 아이들이 많아. 나는 운이 좋은 편이였지.","source_cn":"锈锚港有很多像我这样的孩子，我是幸运的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CAC46EEBA78AAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241126004:1":{"text":"테시오도 나를 남자아이로 알고 입양했었어.","source_cn":"泰西欧收养我时，一开始也以为我是男孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4782BC87E6CCC206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241126005:1":{"text":"내가 여자아이라는 걸 알게 되었을 때, 난 그가 입양한 다른 남자아이들에 비해 훨씬 더 뛰어났고.","source_cn":"等他发现我是女孩时，我已经比他收养的其他男孩都要优秀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01C38D5BDBC68FB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241126006:1":{"text":"나의 과거가 지금의 나를 만들었어. 그러니까 나는 부끄럽지 않아.","source_cn":"我的过去铸造了今天的我，我从不为过去感到羞耻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6FEE75EF1AE88DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241126007:1":{"text":"오히려 지금의 내가 있을 수 있도록 필사적으로 노력한 과거의 소니아에게 감사해.","source_cn":"相反，我感谢过去的索尼娅，她想尽办法活下来，才有了现在的我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF98EF05E927143EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241126008:1":{"text":"와... 소니아, 정말 대단해요!","source_cn":"哇……索尼娅好、好强大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE005D5A5879864A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241126009:1":{"text":"정말 힘이 있는 말이에요!","source_cn":"好有力的发言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC129FF9FFC0CAF5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241126010:1":{"text":"솔직히 말하면 나도 먹고살 걱정이 없는 사람들을 부러워했어.","source_cn":"坦白说，我也羡慕过那些一生下来就不用为吃喝发愁的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7236808DE75DDEA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241126011:1":{"text":"그들은 나와 다르게 돌아가지 않아도 되니 항상 앞으로 나아가거든.","source_cn":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163C882AAB6BCF2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1241126011":{"text":"그들은 나와 다르게 돌아가지 않아도 되니 항상 앞으로 나아가거든.","source_cn":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163C882AAB6BCF2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241126012:1":{"text":"그런 적도 있었지만, 나중엔 알겠더라고.","source_cn":"也有过，后来我想通了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7462B86AE24E88A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241126013:1":{"text":"운명은 시간과 가족에 의해 벽에 못박힌 끈이라는 걸.","source_cn":"命运，是被时代和家庭钉在墙上的麻绳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A6A57C620BEE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241126014:1":{"text":"하지만 못박힌 자리만 바꿀 수 없을 뿐, 줄은 얼마든지 손목을 돌려서 당길 수 있지.","source_cn":"但除了那些无法改变的定点，我可以转动手腕，紧紧拽住绳子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x046E8BD1B1DE0EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241126015:1":{"text":"내가 잃어버린 건 직접 손에 넣을 수 있어.","source_cn":"我所缺失的，我会亲手拿到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47EC922912EBD1E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241126016:1":{"text":"그리고 나에게는 가족인 나라가 있잖아.","source_cn":"更何况，我还有奈拉，她就是我的家人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35378FCBD596EFD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241126017:1":{"text":"서로에게 기대어 보낸 그 시간을 나는 영원히 잊지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"我永远无法忘记，我们互相支撑度过的那段时光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185E7FB2EF284FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241126018:1":{"text":"나라도 잊을 수 없던 게 아닐까? 그러니까 지금 나를 찾아서 돌아온 거지.","source_cn":"她不是也忘不了吗？所以现在回来找我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE8F58AEBB168CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1241126019:1":{"text":"소니아, 이런 농담은 재미없어요...","source_cn":"索尼娅，这个冷笑话不好笑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2D3FD2D814ADBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1241126020:1":{"text":"너희도 알 거야. 나는... 나라에게 너무 미안해. 그러니까 모두 갚을 수 있는 기회가 생기면 좋겠어.","source_cn":"你们知道的，奈拉……我对不起她。希望能有机会弥补她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5672856F4E716E89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1241126021:1":{"text":"할 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"我们相信你能做到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25C242FF60E6632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1241126022:1":{"text":"응... 할 수 있을 거야. 해내야만 해.","source_cn":"对……我能做到。我应该做到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x814D11CC33B5024A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"원망스럽지 않아?","source_cn":"不会怨恨吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC32DE107FB53A079","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"원망스럽지 않아?","female":"원망스럽지 않아?","variant_male_record_index":"66534","variant_female_record_index":"66535","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"불공평하다고 생각하지 않아?","source_cn":"不会觉得不公平吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x90AF7F34AAD2EFAC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"불공평하다고 